  "AppName": "RENPHO Health",
  "Description": "RENPHO Health is a health and body-composition tracking app and the mobile companion to Renpho's Bluetooth hardware. Users register an account, sign in or continue as a guest, then create a personal profile with gender, height and birthday, and can add extra profiles for family members. Compatible devices are paired over Bluetooth from an Add Device flow: smart body-fat scales, a smart jump rope, a smart treadmill, a tape measure and a nutrition scale. Measurements sync into the app, which shows body-composition metrics such as BMI, body fat, body water, bone mass, basal metabolism, body age and muscle mass, keeps a dated measurement history, draws trend charts over selectable time ranges, and can generate and share a health report. Settings cover the account, app permissions, managing connected devices, and connecting third-party health platforms with a per-data-item authorization step.",
